{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage an interstellar spy business in a strategy game with lunchbreak runs. The demo let's you play a few of the unlimited procedurally generated maps of the full game, explore a limited number of technologies and tests you with a couple of rounds of corporate retaliations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.poster.avif?t=1757673809\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.webm?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.mp4?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a randomly generated universe with your trusted probe. Find planets, asteroids and space stations. Expand your empire by building relays, operations hubs and admin centers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.poster.avif?t=1757673809\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.webm?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.mp4?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch operations from your hubs, target planets and their corporations to steal their data. Target corporations with multiple agents to maximize your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.poster.avif?t=1757673809\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.webm?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.mp4?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the stolen data to the highest bidder - or keep the data to yourself to keep a corporation from gaining too much influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/42a24db59dd980d56e6b6c6ea1b4a511.avif?t=1757673809\" width=1035 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your data go to good use as you change the corporate landscape by strategic sale of information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.poster.avif?t=1757673809\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.webm?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.mp4?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and steal technology, develop it and put the technology to good use - spying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make enough money to earn your retirement on a private planet - or end up failing and bumming it on a cheap asteroid with your space dog.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732160?t=1757673809","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/259ee0b6337271b5a6e16e6b5eb04197bea3c916/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757673809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/c59f052907d9fb7b82c670444f7726153647fc49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757673809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/c59f052907d9fb7b82c670444f7726153647fc49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757673809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage an interstellar spy business in a strategy game with lunchbreak runs. The demo let's you play a few of the unlimited procedurally generated maps of the full game, explore a limited number of technologies and tests you with a couple of rounds of corporate retaliations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.poster.avif?t=1757673809\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732160/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.webm?t=1757673809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st